 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nAtelier Provence SAS                                           MASTER SERVICES\n45 Avenue Victor Hugo, 69001 Lyon, France                           AGREEMENT\nN° TVA: FR15 423184542\nReg No: FR-775484\n\nFROM                                                           FACTURÉ À\nAtelier Provence SAS                                           Société Lumière SARL\n45 Avenue Victor Hugo                                          45 Avenue Victor Hugo\n69001 Lyon                                                     75008 Paris\nFrance                                                         France\nVAT: FR15 423184542\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 19/03/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and\nbetween Atelier Provence SAS, with its registered office at 45 Avenue Victor Hugo, Lyon (\"Party A\"), and Société Lumière\nSARL, with its registered office at 45 Avenue Victor Hugo, Paris (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in\naccordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the\npurposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of England and Wales.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A      Atelier Provence SAS / Sophie Bernard\nParty B      Société Lumière SARL / Sophie Bernard\nDate         19/03/2026",
